One of the great fetures of nethack, in my mind one of the best anyways is
the "/" key.
When you hit the / key you get two choices, the game will ask you if you
want to identify something by the cursor or not. If you pick the cursor
method then move the cursor over to the object you would like more
information on, and it will tell you what it is. In most cases it will ask
you if you want to know more. If you say yes to this question it will give
you a brief bit of text relating to the creature. This could be a
description, a poem, a snippet from a book, whatever the dev team thinks is
appropriate.

If you chose to not use the cursor then you have to type in the name of what
you want to know more about. You can do this for things in the game that you
can't find in the game. Gods and the like.



